    "intro": "Published October 22, 2026. Keep After-Call Work Coding Evidence Traceable gives contact-center teams a bounded operating method. It preserves evidence, separates action from authority, and requires destination verification before closure. For after-call work disposition coding, this control connects the governing request and record to the receiving queue for support and management review.",
